      "The gorge may be visited year-round. It is necessary to have an oﬃcial guide to visit the actual excavations. Length: 55 km (34m) | Deep: 100 m | Excavation Since : 1930s",
      "Olduvai Gorge Museum exhibits numerous fossils, stone tools of our hominid ancestors and skeletons of many extinct animals excavated in the gorge. ",
